VIEWMODEL.md J3: an absent optional member (params, required=false) next to an "always present"
one kept even empty (fields, wire), an empty non-nil slice staying present (fields: []), a
pointer-to-zero member staying present (select: "", signed: false, missing: 0, code: 0), and the
J9 `{"text": …}` object form nested at depth >= 3.
-- input.json --
{
  "types": {
    "pkg.Empty": {"kind": "record", "name": "Empty", "fields": []},
    "pkg.T": {"kind": "record", "name": "T", "fields": [
      {
        "name": "f", "type": {"kind": "int", "bits": 8, "signed": false}, "required": false,
        "help": {"text": "F help"}, "wire": {"name": "f"}
